{"4555790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Die of Flower", "steam_appid": 4555790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Die of Flower is a top-down perspective format that gradually reconstructs the entire story by using the special effects of cards. The story may have an order, but the order is not unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/364426f73964a1f13741c358906c0716.poster.avif?t=1777092242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/364426f73964a1f13741c358906c0716.webm?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/364426f73964a1f13741c358906c0716.mp4?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Die of Flower sets at least one pass condition in each scene, and these conditions are written on some special cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Die of Flower assists in completing levels through various actions, such as moving, talking, and handing the cards in your hand to the other party. These actions have special significance in The Die of Flower and can ensure the character's survival. if an important character dies, a failure result will occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/dc0a1d9d079bdb03686846db6ba390c6.poster.avif?t=1777092242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/dc0a1d9d079bdb03686846db6ba390c6.webm?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/dc0a1d9d079bdb03686846db6ba390c6.mp4?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time a special effect is used, the text on the card will be recorded on the right. The smoother the recorded text reads, the closer it is to the original meaning of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/b626521152045892a3c6316c317c2d52.poster.avif?t=1777092242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/b626521152045892a3c6316c317c2d52.webm?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/b626521152045892a3c6316c317c2d52.mp4?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Die of Flower is a top-down perspective format that gradually reconstructs the entire story by using the special effects of cards. The story may have an order, but the order is not unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/364426f73964a1f13741c358906c0716.poster.avif?t=1777092242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/364426f73964a1f13741c358906c0716.webm?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/364426f73964a1f13741c358906c0716.mp4?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Die of Flower sets at least one pass condition in each scene, and these conditions are written on some special cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Die of Flower assists in completing levels through various actions, such as moving, talking, and handing the cards in your hand to the other party. These actions have special significance in The Die of Flower and can ensure the character's survival. if an important character dies, a failure result will occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/dc0a1d9d079bdb03686846db6ba390c6.poster.avif?t=1777092242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/dc0a1d9d079bdb03686846db6ba390c6.webm?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/dc0a1d9d079bdb03686846db6ba390c6.mp4?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time a special effect is used, the text on the card will be recorded on the right. The smoother the recorded text reads, the closer it is to the original meaning of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/b626521152045892a3c6316c317c2d52.poster.avif?t=1777092242\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/b626521152045892a3c6316c317c2d52.webm?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/extras/b626521152045892a3c6316c317c2d52.mp4?t=1777092242\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The Die of Flower is a text-based puzzle game based on dice rolling. It is primarily designed for two players, but one person can still experience it. Solving each condition counts as completing each segment of the story, and when there is nothing left to solve, that is when the story ends.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/31c60a4e7ca7831361ce89d09cf11cde98e171c4/header.jpg?t=1777092242", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/2b6123bda8e8f5a134759afb56ca7cbe5736fc2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777092242", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4555790/2b6123bda8e8f5a134759afb56ca7cbe5736fc2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777092242", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD R5 4600/Intel i5 10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4G VRM NVIDA GTX 1650/AMD Radeon 550<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD R5 4600/Intel i5 10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4G VRM NVIDA GTX 1650/AMD Radeon 550<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul